TemsProtect

This product is a rebranded fork of CoreProtect, originally created by Intelli
and the CoreProtect contributors (https://github.com/PlayPro/CoreProtect).

The internal Java packages (net.coreprotect.*), the CoreProtectAPI class, the
CoreProtectPreLogEvent class, the coreprotect:* plugin-message channels and the
embedded database table prefix (co_) are retained for compatibility with
existing plugins, client mods and databases.

TemsProtect-specific changes are maintained by Phantom6422.

